(text "Nominal dump ON ~15.39V / OFF ~14.6V; verify tolerance and switching overshoot.\nEach external resistor sees about 72W at 15.4V while ON. Fit >=100W on chassis.\nNot powered from 3V3: dump stays available when logic protection is off.\nA TVS alone cannot ensure the 17V module limit. Connect dump before bench tests." (at 603 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left)) (uuid "e4b0ae5e-f2f9-534b-91d3-42becec96ddb"))
(text "电机模块版型、排距适配和Rsense尚需实物确认。\n两对排母的封装与3D位置均使用原PCB排距。\n本图新增器件尚未布入PCB，不可据旧PCB生产。" (at 605 284.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left)) (uuid "bc069d8b-bf31-59e7-9f23-0521c605398a"))
